[size=5][b]Installation[/b][/size]
[b]Installer[/b] — run the setup .exe. It creates a Start-menu shortcut and installs the WebView2 runtime if it is not already present.
[b]Portable[/b] — unzip the portable .zip and run Palbox Studio.exe. No installation is required; keep the folder contents together.
[b]Vortex[/b] — the portable folder can be registered as a Vortex tool: on the Palworld dashboard, [b]+ Add Tool -> New...[/b], and set [b]Target[/b] to Palbox Studio.exe.

Windows 11 includes the required WebView2 runtime. On earlier versions of Windows, install the Microsoft Edge WebView2 Runtime if the application does not start.

[b][color=#e0b050]Save safety:[/color][/b] A verified backup is written before any save modifies your file. Close Palworld before saving edits. The Global Palbox is located at %LOCALAPPDATA%\Pal\Saved\SaveGames\<id>\GlobalPalStorage.sav. Keeping an independent copy of important saves is recommended.

